<title>PHILIPPINES: ICTSI sets Aug 22 record date.</title>
<headline>ICTSI sets Aug 22 record date.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Container Terminal Services Inc (ICTSI) said on Friday the Securities and Exchange Commission had set August 22 as the record date for its 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The ex-dividend date is set on August 18.</p>
<p>ICTSI is a port operator.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
